# Frameworks Archive

Goldmine of Feb-July 2025 framework explorations. Source: Google Drive.
These are `.gdoc` link files -- open in browser via double-click.

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.name AS "Framework",
  file.ext AS "Type",
  file.ctime AS "Created"
FROM "_frameworks"
WHERE file.name != "_README"
SORT file.name ASC
```

## Quick Reference
To add metadata to a framework, create a companion `.md` file in `_research/`
with `source_framework: "Framework Name"` in frontmatter.
